                <h3>Our Mission</h3>
                <p>To bridge the technology gap in the social sector by fostering open-source innovation, collaboration, and sustainable solutions that empower nonprofits and social enterprises worldwide.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mission-card mission-card-secondary">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/>
                        <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
                    </svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Our Values</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <span class="value-icon">◆</span>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Open Collaboration & Innovation:</strong> Co-creating transparent, community-led solutions that push what’s possible.
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="value-icon">◆</span>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Sustainability:</strong>  Building tech that lasts—affordable, adaptable, and accessible over time.
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="value-icon">◆</span>
                        <div>
                            <strong>Inclusion:</strong> Ensuring everyone can use, shape, and benefit from open technology.
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="mission-card mission-card-accent">
                <div class="card-icon">
                    <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                        <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"/>
                    </svg>
